{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-aquilegia","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"aquilegia-arabtec-damac-hills-2","about":"Aquilegia is a residential community located in the Damac Hills 2 neighbourhood. The development consists exclusively of three-bedroom villas. The developer of the buildings is Arabtec Construction. Aquilegia villas are equipped with terraces, BBQ area, private Jacuzzi, children's play area, golf course and rooftop facilities.The complex is equipped with 24-hour CCTV and a centralised cooling system. There are also 2 car parking spaces per villa. Aquilegia (Damac Hills 2) has a fishing lake, boating lake, butterfly garden, cricket pitch, football pitch, floating cinema, giant chess, jogging tracks, artificial beach, paddle tennis court, picnic park, snack bar, volleyball court;Aquapark, amphitheatre, open-air cinema, outdoor gym, bicycle paths, swimming pools.In 25 minutes by car you can get to a large shopping centre Mall of the Emirates, which is located: shops of world brands, popular indoor skiing complex Ski Dubai, cinema Vox Cinemas, restaurants and cafes P.F. Chang's, L'Erie. Chang's, L'ETO, More Cafe.The Damac Hills 2 neighbourhood has kindergartens and schools, which can be reached within an average 30-minute drive.Anaya, Ace and Aster clinics are all within a 30-minute drive. They offer residents of the neighbourhood a full package of medical services. Al Maktoum International Airport is 45 minutes away and Dubai International Airport is 40 minutes away.","price":1600000,"title":"Aquilegia","bitrix":{"id":547,"pf_id":"are.2.9426","source":null,"project_id":"Aquilegia","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Aquilegia","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Damac Properties","project_location":"Damac Hills 2"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1481/images/2024/03/20/340x252/kbrkeNygCTi0ToTBrrRGczEYuUplN4GNzyAR7u